  m_text: "<b>EXERCISE \xB7 CHAIN REACTION</b>\nOne push (Space, in Play) must end with the alarm clock on the floor.\nThe chain must use a bounce, a hinge and a custom force. Parts wait in the tray (right);\nmove, rotate, duplicate and tune them. More parts: Physics/Shared/Palette in the Project window."
